<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 0.5in">Concurrently with the execution and delivery of
the Merger Agreement, certain new and existing institutional and accredited investors of Pre-Merger Yarrow entered into a securities purchase
