Change&#8221;), in each case as described in the Proxy Statement/Prospectus. Following the Special Meeting, the Board approved the Reverse
Stock Split at a ratio of 1-for-50. To effect the Reverse Stock Split, the Company filed a Certificate of Amendment to the Company&#8217;s
