<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 0.5in"><b>William White, J.D. </b>Mr. White, age 53, has
served as a member of Pre-Merger Yarrow&#8217;s board of directors since April 2026. Since June 2026, Mr. White has served as Chief Financial
Officer &amp; Head of Corporate Development of Avere Therapeutics, Inc., a privately-held biotechnology company. Mr. White served as the
Executive Vice President, Chief Financial Officer and Head of Corporate Development and Treasurer at Akero Therapeutics, Inc. (Nasdaq:
